      ],
      "text": "A curated markdown knowledge corpus is embedded in the binary and extracted to ~/.umadev/knowledge on first launch; retrieval uses BM25 plus optional vector embeddings fused with RRF and HyDE-style expansion, falling back to BM25-only when vectors are unavailable."
    },
