        "slc_ad2db6f89994616b4ffaac13934dd9297ddc2d29b128e761f73eb851126c8850"
      ],
      "text": "Plan intent is mapped to each vendor's real permission surface rather than advertised as a uniform hard sandbox; explicit no-write intent, the single-writer rule, and irreversible-action safeguards are described as hard ceilings."
